    <h2>Satire and fictional scenarios</h2>
    <p>Coalition Chaos is a satirical educational game. Its invented dialogue, motives and outcomes are not actual quotations, allegations of wrongdoing or predictions. Caricatures do not imply a person’s participation or endorsement. Sourced historical backstories describe their stated time and place, not necessarily the current political position. Read the <a href="/terms#satire">game’s context and limitations</a>.</p>

    <h2>Always check official sources</h2>
    <p>Always verify information with the relevant official sources before relying on it or making a decision. Check election results against the <a href="https://results.elections.org.za/">IEC’s official results</a>, and use the <a href="https://registertovote.elections.org.za/">IEC’s voter portal</a> to check your registration and voting station.</p>
    <p>Results may be provisional, and estimates or coalition scenarios on Counted are not official outcomes. A map or address match here does not confirm where you are registered or entitled to vote. If this project differs from an official source, rely on the official source.</p>
